1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,994
Halo adik-adik! Selamat datang di Lumo & Gaja!

2
00:00:05,344 --> 00:00:07,062
Halo! Aku Lumo!

3
00:00:07,412 --> 00:00:09,734
Ini temanku, Gaja si gajah!

4
00:00:10,084 --> 00:00:13,114
Hari ini kita belajar warna. Ayo!

5
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:15,971
Lihat! Apa ini?

6
00:00:16,321 --> 00:00:18,457
Ini apel. Warnanya merah!

7
00:00:18,807 --> 00:00:20,746
Merah. In English, red!

8
00:00:21,096 --> 00:00:21,827
Merah... red!

9
00:00:22,177 --> 00:00:23,768
Stroberi juga merah!

10
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:26,243
Ayo ulangi bersama: merah!

11
00:00:29,793 --> 00:00:32,893
Apel merah, apel merah, manis sekali!

12
00:00:33,243 --> 00:00:36,622
Stroberi merah, stroberi merah, segar sekali!

13
00:00:36,972 --> 00:00:39,468
Merah, merah, merah! Hore!

14
00:00:40,618 --> 00:00:42,092
Wah, lihat itu!

15
00:00:42,442 --> 00:00:44,915
Ini pisang. Warnanya kuning!

16
00:00:45,265 --> 00:00:47,459
Kuning. In English, yellow!

17
00:00:47,809 --> 00:00:48,900
Kuning... yellow!

18
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,829
Matahari juga kuning!

19
00:00:51,179 --> 00:00:53,304
Ayo ulangi bersama: kuning!

20
00:00:56,854 --> 00:00:59,977
Pisang kuning, pisang kuning, lezat sekali!

21
00:01:00,327 --> 00:01:03,659
Matahari kuning, matahari kuning, hangat sekali!

22
00:01:04,009 --> 00:01:06,459
Kuning, kuning, kuning! Hore!

23
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:09,745
Gaja, lihat ke atas!

24
00:01:10,095 --> 00:01:12,347
Itu langit. Warnanya biru!

25
00:01:12,697 --> 00:01:14,868
Biru. In English, blue!

26
00:01:15,218 --> 00:01:16,182
Biru... blue!

27
00:01:16,532 --> 00:01:17,867
Air juga biru!

28
00:01:18,217 --> 00:01:20,353
Ayo ulangi bersama: biru!

29
00:01:23,903 --> 00:01:26,887
Langit biru, langit biru, tinggi sekali!

30
00:01:27,237 --> 00:01:29,896
Air biru, air biru, sejuk sekali!

31
00:01:30,246 --> 00:01:32,533
Biru, biru, biru! Hore!

32
00:01:33,683 --> 00:01:36,887
Sekarang permainan! Mana yang warna merah?

33
00:01:40,437 --> 00:01:42,446
Betul! Apel itu merah!

34
00:01:42,796 --> 00:01:44,329
Mana yang warna kuning?

35
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:49,783
Hebat! Pisang itu kuning!

36
00:01:50,133 --> 00:01:51,747
Mana yang warna biru?

37
00:01:55,297 --> 00:01:57,364
Pintar! Bola itu biru!

38
00:01:58,514 --> 00:02:00,894
Sekarang ayo cari warna di taman!

39
00:02:01,244 --> 00:02:03,427
Gaja, mana bunga yang merah?

40
00:02:06,977 --> 00:02:08,869
Ketemu! Bunga merah!

41
00:02:09,219 --> 00:02:11,169
Sekarang, mana bunga yang kuning?

42
00:02:14,719 --> 00:02:16,658
Ketemu! Bunga kuning!

43
00:02:17,008 --> 00:02:19,040
Terakhir, mana bunga yang biru?

44
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:24,517
Ketemu! Bunga biru!

45
00:02:25,667 --> 00:02:28,152
Hari ini kita belajar tiga warna.

46
00:02:28,502 --> 00:02:33,181
Merah seperti apel. Kuning seperti pisang. Biru seperti langit.

47
00:02:33,531 --> 00:02:37,084
Merah, kuning, biru! Warna-warni itu indah!

48
00:02:37,434 --> 00:02:39,489
Sampai jumpa, teman-teman!

49
00:02:39,839 --> 00:02:42,846
Sampai jumpa lagi di Lumo & Gaja!
